data: {"id": "a5300db1a67846c8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1312", "run_id": "a5300db1a67846c8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已经获取了 Pod 的描述和事件，关键事实如下：\n\n1.  **Pod 状态**: `status: Running`（说明当前 Pod 实例正在运行，不是完全的 CrashLoop 循环无法启动，但之前有反复重启历史）。\n2.  **关键事件**:\n    *   `Liveness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 500` (24分钟前发生，x8次)。这表明应用虽然启动，但健康检查失败，导致 kubelet 杀死容器并重启。\n    *   `Back-off restarting failed container app` (118秒前，x83次)。这确认了容器经历了大量的重启尝试。\n    *   `Container app failed liveness probe, will be restarted`。\n3.  **Exit Code**: `137` (OOMKilled)。在 `kubectl_describe` 摘要中提到了 `Exit Code: 137`。这是一个非常关键的信息，Exit Co", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789095909703, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

